stellar-archivist-rs (0.0.0-1) stable; urgency=medium

  * Seed changelog entry. The published version is set by the package-builder
    pipeline via `dch --newversion=<crate version>-<jenkins build number>`, so
    this upstream version is intentionally low (0.0.0) to always sort below any
    real build. Installs /usr/bin/stellar-archivist-rs.

